      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what are you talking about with \"neutral goblins\" and \"hard-earned gold\"? This is a serious legal transaction and I'm trying to understand the actual financial mechanics of how my money is protected. Can you just explain the professional role of the escrow agent and the legal oversight involved without these weird metaphors?",
