      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that's a bit more helpful. but i'm still nervous about the actual security. if this neutral third party is just some person or company holding onto a huge amount of my money, how do I know they aren't just keeping it for themselves or being bribed by the seller? are there actually any \"hidden\" risks or suspicious things I should watch out for during this part of the process?",
